# box-dblclick (M7): k's box (centre (383, 468) at 1440 x 900) dragged +50 px to 1.00 and let go:
# the ruler goes, ↺ comes into the row (where a flip toggle would be: (296, 456.5, 24 x 24)), the
# box keeps the focus without the ring, P's ghost lingers 600 ms on the plane. Then a double-click
# on the box resets k to 0.00 (a jump), whatever the first click opened.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 2000
move 383 468
wait 16
down
move 433 468 over 160
up
wait 16
shot released
wait 1000
shot settled
dblclick 433 468
wait 1000
shot reset
